{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52219","headline":"颂六十二首 四十四 · 道世","name":"颂六十二首 四十四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"枢机巧对辩，善诱令心伏。\n八水润焦芽，三明啓瞽目。\n来问各不同，詶答皆芬郁。\n冀舍四龙惊，亦除二鼠逼。\n意树发空华，心莲吐轻馥。\n喻此沧海变，譬彼庵罗熟。\n妙智方缛锦，词深同雾縠。\n善学乖梵爪，真言异鍱腹。\n（见同书卷六六《罗汉部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"道世","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52219.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52219","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}